{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"運輸署：咪錶泊車系統早上8時20分起故障　正緊急搶修\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/PARKI-ERROR-261103-1030.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】咪錶泊車系統早上故障，多個咪錶顯示停用，運輸署表示正緊急搶修。</p><p>運輸署總運輸主任梁日喬：「上午約八時二十分接獲營運商報告，咪錶泊車系統出現故障，現正緊急搶修。署方已責成營運商從速跟進修復工作，將對駕駛人士的影響減至最低，並徹查事故原因及提交報告。如果有查詢，駕駛人士可致電服務熱線23323700。」</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:21:36.516891+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:34:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T02:38:18.620524+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:18:40.634389+00:00","content_hash":"f3c5c847a7e243d6c25104fdc0b7477988a26581e5fbff14b0ea62a0c2129500","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:21:36.516891+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}